  insert into public.lesson_materials(lesson_id,content) values (v_lesson,'{"skill":"Reading","passage":"Lan is nineteen and comes from Da Nang. This year she is studying hospitality at a college in Brisbane, Australia, and she rents a small room in a shared house near the river.\n\nOn weekdays Lan wakes up at half past six. She rarely has a big breakfast; usually she just makes toast and a cup of tea. At quarter past seven she catches the ferry, which she prefers to the bus because it is quieter and she can read on the way. Classes start at eight and finish at two.\n\nThree afternoons a week Lan works in a hotel café. The job is tiring, but she says it helps her English more than any textbook, because she has to understand customers who speak quickly and use a lot of informal words. On the other afternoons she studies in the college library.\n\nIn the evening Lan cooks with her housemates, who come from Brazil, Japan and Canada. They always speak English together, and every Friday each person cooks a dish from their own country. Lan often makes fresh spring rolls. Before bed she calls her family in Vietnam, although the time difference means she sometimes has to wait until they finish dinner.","figure":{"url":"","alt":""}}'::jsonb)
